-- UInt32 elements: the 4-byte layer, the Int64 development at width 4 (two more trusted laws of
-- the byte layer: a 32-bit load disjoint from a store, and 32-bit arrays determined by their
-- elements); UInt32 is not equivalent to Int64, so it has its own layer
Array32 : Nat → Type
Array32 n = Bytes (times n 4)
